# Comprehensive Native Executable Verification Harness for A2UI & Dynamic App Interfaces
#
# Compiled and executed natively via pure-Simple `simple native-build --backend=cranelift`
# to verify all Section 22 correctness and security acceptance criteria end-to-end.

